  "segments": [
    {
      "idx": 0,
      "kind": "teach",
      "state": "hook",
      "qaIndex": null,
      "keycard": null,
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "exam_context.student_facing_hook",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "先给你一个考试视角：网络计划题，表面问关键线路，实际要三件事：路径、总工期、判断依据。后面索赔和工期调整，也都靠这三件事。今天只练一个动作：把图，变成能拿分的一句话。",
      "startSec": 0,
      "durSec": 16.608,
      "requestId": "07761bb3-061d-936f-bc8d-3fe4452713ad",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 1,
      "kind": "teach",
      "state": "trap",
      "qaIndex": null,
      "keycard": null,
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "teaching_spine.wrong_idea",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "所以第一步不是算，而是先防错觉。很多人一眼看见 C 工作四天最长，就说关键线路是 C。这里已经错了：C 只是一个工作，不是一条线。",
      "startSec": 17.008,
      "durSec": 11.736,
      "requestId": "9c495985-3190-9b35-8b36-ff1e7cc00d06",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 2,
      "kind": "teach",
      "state": "logic",
      "qaIndex": null,
      "keycard": null,
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "question_data.dependencies",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "接下来才读箭线。A、B 可以同时开始；C、D 要等 A；D 还要等 B；E 要等 C 和 D。箭线读错，顺推、逆推都会跟着错。",
      "startSec": 29.144,
      "durSec": 11.616,
      "requestId": "3d6c9229-073a-9f42-841d-8912a140cab8",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 3,
      "kind": "teach",
      "state": "forward",
      "qaIndex": null,
      "keycard": null,
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "question_data.activities",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "顺推最早时间时，遇到多个紧前工作，取完成最晚的那个。C 在第七天完成，D 在第五天完成，所以 E 只能等到第七天开始。",
      "startSec": 41.16,
      "durSec": 11.28,
      "requestId": "c9ebab94-fbb5-9be4-b386-97420c1beca6",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 4,
      "kind": "teach",
      "state": "backward",
      "qaIndex": null,
      "keycard": null,
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "question_data.expected.float",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "有了总工期，再逆推最迟时间。逆推问的不是重新算一遍，而是：不拖总工期时，每项工作最晚还能什么时候开始、什么时候完成。",
      "startSec": 52.84,
      "durSec": 11.328,
      "requestId": "89a9d6ad-8788-9b4e-849e-2a732145aeda",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 5,
      "kind": "teach",
      "state": "float",
      "qaIndex": null,
      "keycard": null,
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "question_data.expected.float",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "现在看总时差。B 有三天总时差，D 有两天总时差，说明它们有缓冲。能拖的工作，不控制总工期。",
      "startSec": 64.568,
      "durSec": 9.096,
      "requestId": "4881f6f8-9852-9ee1-ae95-4b91bbd66e8e",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 6,
      "kind": "teach",
      "state": "critical",
      "qaIndex": null,
      "keycard": null,
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "question_data.expected.critical_path",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "把总时差为零的工作连成一条连续线：开始，A，C，E，结束。这条线没有缓冲，所以它控制总工期，总工期是十天。",
      "startSec": 74.064,
      "durSec": 12.192,
      "requestId": "b2a76f2b-757a-994b-9fcf-4c79ec728360",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 7,
      "kind": "teach",
      "state": "score",
      "qaIndex": null,
      "keycard": null,
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "teaching_spine.exam_phrase",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "最后落到答题纸：关键线路为开始，A，C，E，结束，总工期十天；理由是 A、C、E 的总时差均为零。你不是在写结论，是在写采分点。",
      "startSec": 86.656,
      "durSec": 13.896,
      "requestId": "7d27a34a-c7de-9f75-a31f-8ba3c3cfad11",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 8,
      "kind": "q",
      "state": "conclude",
      "qaIndex": 0,
      "keycard": null,
      "speaker": "S",
      "voice": "Ethan",
      "anchor": null,
      "claim": false,
      "text": "老师，所以最长工作不能直接当关键线路，对吗？",
      "startSec": 100.952,
      "durSec": 3.76,
      "requestId": "8ac63d46-89ef-9136-ae62-5d2c3e655678",
      "provider": "aliyun_qwen_tts",
      "model": "qwen3-tts-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 9,
      "kind": "a",
      "state": "conclude",
      "qaIndex": 0,
      "keycard": null,
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "teaching_spine.visual_correction",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "对。最长工作只是一个点，关键线路是一条从开始到结束的路。判断它，要看这条路上的工作是否总时差为零。",
      "startSec": 105.112,
      "durSec": 9.792,
      "requestId": "41852aba-c5c2-9cb4-b006-de3cdc379a6d",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 10,
      "kind": "q",
      "state": "conclude",
      "qaIndex": 1,
      "keycard": null,
      "speaker": "S",
      "voice": "Ethan",
      "anchor": null,
      "claim": false,
      "text": "那我能不能只把每条路的工期加起来，选最长？",
      "startSec": 115.304,
      "durSec": 3.28,
      "requestId": "dd7ce737-01cd-9792-92ba-9924ea65dc73",
      "provider": "aliyun_qwen_tts",
      "model": "qwen3-tts-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 11,
      "kind": "a",
      "state": "conclude",
      "qaIndex": 1,
      "keycard": null,
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "question_data.dependencies",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "可以作为检查，但不能跳过逻辑关系。像 D 要同时等 A 和 B，E 要同时等 C 和 D；不按紧前紧后读，路本身可能就读错。",
      "startSec": 118.984,
      "durSec": 10.8,
      "requestId": "9edb78ce-a560-99b0-b2a3-190d35b0a0b4",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 12,
      "kind": "q",
      "state": "conclude",
      "qaIndex": 2,
      "keycard": null,
      "speaker": "S",
      "voice": "Ethan",
      "anchor": null,
      "claim": false,
      "text": "总时差和自由时差，我还是容易混。",
      "startSec": 130.184,
      "durSec": 2.96,
      "requestId": "286374cb-5e79-96e1-882a-aae542211a22",
      "provider": "aliyun_qwen_tts",
      "model": "qwen3-tts-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 13,
      "kind": "a",
      "state": "conclude",
      "qaIndex": 2,
      "keycard": null,
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "question_data.expected.float",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "记住问法不同：总时差问拖多久不影响总工期；自由时差问拖多久不影响紧后工作最早开始。比如 B，总时差三天，自由时差只有一天。",
      "startSec": 133.544,
      "durSec": 12.696,
      "requestId": "1ca3b2ca-9c7f-9278-b4bc-1450fd0374e7",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 14,
      "kind": "a",
      "state": "closing",
      "qaIndex": null,
      "keycard": null,
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "teaching_spine.exam_phrase",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "收个尾：网络计划题，别背关键线路四个字。先把图翻译成三件套：路径、总工期、判断依据。现在进闯关，练到一眼能写出采分句。",
      "startSec": 146.64,
      "durSec": 12.576,
      "requestId": "ae558c5c-94b5-9100-9c10-aa7a1ad52d4b",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    }
  ]
